l or comparative evidence for the economy, does not develop the Abraham Accords’ significance, and only partially answers why character should matter less than policy. Live burden: Her defense must explain the moral weighting that reconciles Christian humility with support for provocative leadership, not merely show that some policies were desirable."}}
